{"text": "1.\n\nEXHIBIT 1 (Option A)\nCOMMERCIAL LAND USE QUESTIONNAIRE\nQuestions to Select Questionnaire Module(s)\n\nAre there currently or have there been in the past any of the following items on the property? (\"\u201c\"\nthose that apply)\nWells (Module A-1, Web No. 14)\nLagoons, settling basins, or waste water treatment basins (Module A-2, Web No. 15)\nVehicle/motor repair or gas station (Module A-6, Web No. 19)\n\nOn-site processes involving use, storage, treatment, or disposal of hazardous\nsubstances, wastes, petroleum products, biohazards, or other regulated materials\n(Module A-7, Web No. 20)\n\nGeneration of petroleum wastes, or liquid or solid wastes other than domestic\nGarbage (Module B, Web No. 21)\n\nApplication, storage, or disposed of pesticides, herbicides, or fumigants or other\nAgricultural chemicals (Module C, Web No. 22)\n\nDrums, sacks, boxes, pails, or other containers of chemicals or hazardous or\nToxic materials (Module D, Web No. 23)\n\nUnderground storage tanks (Module E-1, Web No. 24)\nAboveground storage tanks (Module E-2, Web No. 25)\nAboveground or underground pipelines (Module F, Web No. 26)\nElectrical transformers, capacitors, or other equipment potentially containing\nPCBs (Module G, Web No. 27)\nAre any of the following structures currently on the property?\nBuildings constructed before 1982 that have either finished interiors, a shingled\n\nRoof, a plumbing system, or a heating system (Module A-3, Web No. 27)\n\nOne or more residential dwellings; if yes, was the residential dwelling\nconstructed before 1987 (Module A-5, Web No. 18)\n\nHave waste liquids (other than storm water or domestic sewage into a sewer) been discharged on or\nadjacent to the property?\nYes No (If yes, Module H, Web No. 28)\n\nAre potentially significant air emissions generated from on-site processes or large capacity fuel-\nburning equipment?\nYes No (If yes, Module I, Web No. 29)\n\nCommercialLandUseQuestionnaire.doc 1",
